            "_key": "a3-o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Server-side rendering is the quiet advantage. With Next.js, Googlebot receives full HTML on the first request, so there’s no wait for JavaScript to paint the content. Structured data sits in the templates, no plugin required."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "a3-r",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "a3-q",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "WordPress can rank well, and Yoast or RankMath do help. They also add page weight, and the default category and tag archives can spawn duplicate-content problems if no one prunes them. The gap shows in practice: after moving from a slow platform to Next.js, Efedra reached the top three on Google for its primary keyword within three months."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
